        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paraná pine, standing, under bark, in rain forest</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paraná pine, standing, under bark, in rain forest
data refers to wood 'under bark'. CO2 assimilation is based on 49.4% carbon in the wood including the bark (15%). Biomass energy equals gross calorific value including bark.\nTechnology: natural growth;
Synonyms: Araucaria angustifolia; 
UUID: 76706e4f-d12d-3fe1-84c9-3e4887d6d396
includes the CO2 absorption from air and the land use for the trees to grow (including 15% bark). Forest road area is not included in the land useDensity: 500 kg/m3 (u=0)
Location: undefined
Technology: natural growth; relates to the forest area and CO2 from air needed to produce Paraná pine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76706e4f-d12d-3fe1-84c9-3e4887d6d396.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
